      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When deciding between enclosed containerized carriers and open trailer options for car transportation in Buxar, it is essential to consider various factors that impact the overall quality and protection of your vehicle during the journey.</p>

<h3>Enclosed Containerized Carriers:</h3>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
