    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Carrier Types:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Enclosed carriers come in two main types: tandem axle and multi-level carriers. Tandem axle carriers provide more space for multiple vehicles, while multi-level carriers allow for more efficient use of space by stacking vehicles.</p>
