<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Railway Vehicle Transport:</strong> Indian Railways offers railway vehicle transport services for cars, trucks, and other vehicles. Enclosed containerized carriers are available for enhanced protection during transportation.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Indian Railways Car Transport Booking:</strong> Booking enclosed carriers for car transportation through Indian Railways ensures a secure journey, particularly from Buxar to other locations.</span></li>
</ul>

<h3><strong>Carrier Types:</strong></h3>

